thor_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6 and 4.5.1 (Windows and MacOS)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.6 and 4.5.1, MacOS Sequoia 15.7.3 and Windows 11 24H2 (Build 26100.7623)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn a custom editor tool plugin calling \"EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved()\" marks the current scene as unsaved as denoted by the \"(*)\" in the editor scene tab. Selecting the menu option \"Scene/Reload saved scene\" does not display the \"Please Confirm... Don't Save, Cancel, Save & Reload\" dialog window.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open either attached MRP\n2. Open the main.tscn and other_scene.tscn\n3. Switch to main.tscn scene\n4. In the bottom panel \"My  Panel\" click the \"Click me to ...\" button\n5. Note the scene tab now has the \"( * )\" indicator\n6. Select the menu option \"Scene/Reload saved scene\"\n7. Scene is reloaded WITHOUT a confirmation \n\nExpected behaviour is display a confirmation window.\n\nObservation: After step 5, switch to the \"other_scene.tscn\" scene and then back to the \"main.tscn\" scene and then select \"Scene/Reload saved scene\". The confirmation window is now displayed properly.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mark-scene-as-unsaved-4.5.1-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24988513/mark-scene-as-unsaved-4.5.1-mrp.zip)\n\n[mark-scene-as-unsaved-4.6.0-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24988514/mark-scene-as-unsaved-4.6.0-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.